FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FTheir adult son, Michael, lives with
OL,7,Fhis parents who are now in their
OL,8,Fseventies and care for him around the
OL,9,Fclock. He has autism and has developed
OL,10,Fsymptoms of severe mental illnesses
OL,11,Fand physical health problems,
OL,12,Fincluding psychosis and obsessive
OL,13,Fcompulsive disorder. They say he
OL,14,Fexperiences delusions, refuses food,
OL,15,Fhas started fires inside the family
OL,16,Fhome and sees aliens in people,
OL,17,Fleaving him unwilling to engage with
OL,18,Ftreatment.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FBecause he refuses to be assessed, his
OL,7,Ffamily say professionals have been
OL,8,Funable to provide the support they
OL,9,Fbelieve he urgently needs.
OL,11,FHis mother and brother, Isabella and
OL,12,FNigel Thomas, told ITV News they feel
OL,13,Ftrapped.
OL,15,F"It's like living in hell. Everyday we
OL,16,Ffear the worst could happen." they
OL,17,Fsaid, describing years of trying to
OL,18,Fget help while watching Michael become
OL,19,Fincreasingly unwell.
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@]O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FThe family say every attempt to seek
OL,7,Fsupport has been met with barriers,
OL,8,Fleaving them left to deal with this
OL,9,Falone. They say no agency or support
OL,10,Fsystem is able or willing to take
OL,11,Fresponsibility because of the current
OL,12,Fsystem.
OL,14,FThey say the current legal threshold
OL,15,Ffor serious intervention is too high
OL,16,Fand that services are often unable to
OL,17,Fact until someone presents an
OL,18,Fimmediate risk to themselves or others.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FSpeaking to ITV News, their Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrat MP Tessa Munt, who has raised
OL,8,FMichael's case in Westminster, said
OL,9,Ffamilies like his are falling through
OL,10,Fthe gaps in the mental health system.
OL,11,FShe argues there is support for people
OL,12,Fwith relatively mild mental health
OL,13,Fconditions and intensive services for
OL,14,Fthose in acute crisis, but that the
OL,15,Fthreshold for this is too high,
OL,16,Fleaving lots of people with nowhere to
OL,17,Fturn.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FShe said, "It's so difficult to get
OL,7,Fhelp for people who have a mental
OL,8,Fhealth problem. The services will take
OL,9,Ftop level crisis, that's where they
OL,10,Fwill intervene. We've got some
OL,11,Fbrilliant local organisations who can
OL,12,Fhelp people on the milder end, but
OL,13,Fthere's a walloping great gap in the
OL,14,Fmiddle where people clearly need help."
OL,26,@nD@KOUvD@gO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare said mental health services
OL,8,Fshould provide care in the least
OL,9,Frestrictive way possible, while
OL,10,Fensuring people receive the support
OL,11,Fthey need. It said the government is
OL,12,Finvesting in mental health services.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "We are
OL,7,Fdeveloping a cross-government Mental
OL,8,FHealth Strategy for England that will
OL,9,Ftransform mental health care into a
OL,10,Fsystem that responds earlier, reduces
OL,11,Fwait times, intervenes earlier, and
OL,12,Fhelps people stay active and
OL,13,Fparticipate in education, work, family
OL,14,Fand community life."
OL,16,FMental health charity SANE says it
OL,17,Fregularly hears from families in
OL,18,Fsimilar situations.
OL,26,@nD@VOUvD@TO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FIts founder and chief executive,
OL,7,FMarjorie Wallace, said cases like
OL,8,FMichael's are becoming increasingly
OL,9,Fcommon, with relatives left carrying
OL,10,Fenormous responsibility while
OL,11,Fstruggling to access appropriate care.
OL,13,F"It could've been helped if we hadn't
OL,14,Flost so many beds and mental health
OL,15,Fservices over the years", she says.
OL,26,@uD@AOUwD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FThe case comes as Prime Minister Andy
OL,7,FBurnham announced plans to speed up
OL,8,Freform of England's social care
OL,9,Fsystem, saying too many people and
OL,10,Ffamilies have been let down. Speaking
OL,11,Fon Tuesday, Burnham said successive
OL,12,Fgovernments had failed to tackle the
OL,13,Fissue and confirmed Baroness Louise
OL,14,FCasey's independent review into adult
OL,15,Fsocial care would be brought forward
OL,16,Fto next year as part of plans for a
OL,17,FNational Care Service.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785395897
OL,3,CFamily 'living in hell' caring for
OL,4,Cmentally ill son
OL,6,FWhile the review is focused on broader
OL,7,Fsocial care, Michael's family say
OL,8,Fmental health support must be treated
OL,9,Fwith the same level of care as
OL,10,Fphysical health problems.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
